<description>&lt;p&gt;Syria is negotiating entry into the Mecca defence pact while simultaneously arresting suspected ISIS members linked to assassinations in Deir Ezzor. Jordan halted an armed group trying to cross from Syria and later struck terrorists in retaliation for a church attack, also seizing two million drug pills at the Syrian border. Damascus seized 4.3 million Captagon pills and dismantled thirty drug networks, and it participated in Cairo Water Week to discuss agricultural and water cooperation. The UCDP recorded 2,732 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiiAFBVV95cUxOMXVfVkFlUGYya1F1S09GMzdSMnNkaE9nbmkySGFtSkNHcklPRHdQblA5aEN1WDQ5QnVWb2czb3FocHNRalIwWXEzYl9NTzRJYTFUWGQ1NGpIR09EdkllVGd5QmpmZ21pd2dWRVpEczhvT3ZQUGpPaE1vdUpzN29kdzVTVWh1Uld6?oc=5&quot;&gt;The New York Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMitgFBVV95cUxNUnZYN3pDajdLZXp1ZVlXeF8xTDNIc04xR2tMRXFsUzZsZTh4ckszeDM0V3daV1haWE15THZRUU43QlhxUFZfLWp5Z05SQmVENzBEbGJEcHhRdDR2elJBM2ExRVN2NlNqRldidDJQdXBMLVBUc1BHY0JaZ25Yblpwd2hlRnF6ZEljb3p5d3VxVG9Ya0poeXJWZnEzUmZfclVwSTVROGdkZjJFdDIzczd3TzBja1UxUQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Reuters&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMilgFBVV95cUxQWmZ6WWJtQWE0Nzc4R1Z3NXJrbkxCODNFQVI5YmhGS1Nsdy16cExwZVZ0SURNaUpQNTQ3eDBRUHhKT3I5QmdyR0tjQVhkMWxpdmQwSWF0ekFOSHhSZzRybi1jcml0eElsRGZ0ZTdWNkZRR3ZlN1RiVUFzTHgwTWh2WkxUeElVWThrTndkQjVDdzRtcDdIUXc?oc=5&quot;&gt;1News.az&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMingFBVV95cUxNVEh6V3VHaTh1NmFjeVgwTWpIUl9OT3d3Y1EzckI2VU5UUzlXRVhGSk5IX1pjNXh1b0pheXAwSnlWc2owVUhfYW1OdEFCNnY1YTlxaGpYQ0lrRTJSTjNSVnBQcE1UeGxjMjUtUXZZR2pzbDQzMkZjb0tSbXFIN25FYU45LTJyMmtGbEZ1WW12U2JJZEVoT2NVNy1DT25nQQ?o